    "393510ff2cb1d85389db05d8": {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在屏幕上选择 退料/Unload，打印机将开始自动加热热端，并切断耗材。",
      "text_sha256": "9a6cc20633b883ebb6ad65b7e88620403116475cc194f894f427c7b34fd599bd",
      "heading_path": [
        "如何换料",
